<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>TravelPirates</title><link>https://www.travelpirates.com</link><description>TravelPirates | Best Deals on Vacations, Flights &amp; Hotels</description><lastBuildDate>Wed, 04 Nov 2026 16:45:50 -0500</lastBuildDate><docs>https://www.rssboard.org/rss-specification</docs><generator>TravelPirates Feed</generator><language>en</language><category>Travel</category><atom:link xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" href="https://www.travelpirates.com/feed" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"></atom:link><image><link>https://www.travelpirates.com</link><title>TravelPirates</title><url>https://www.holidaypirates.com/hp-app/icons/favicon-96x96.png</url><description>TravelPirates | Best Deals on Vacations, Flights &amp; Hotels</description><height>96</height><width>96</width></image><item><title>Escape to Cabo with an All-Inclusive Getaway 🥂🏖️</title><link>https://www.travelpirates.com/packages/escape-to-cabo-with-an-all-inclusive-getaway</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.travelpirates.com/packages/escape-to-cabo-with-an-all-inclusive-getaway</guid><pubDate>Wed, 04 Nov 2026 12:51:45 -0500</pubDate><description>Picture this: drinks by the pool while you soak up some sun in Cabo San Lucas! We've got a three-night Cabo beachfront getaway waiting for you. This package includes a stay at the all-inclusive Riu Santa Fe and round-trip flights from various cities, starting from $553 per person.</description><enclosure url="https://image.urlaubspiraten.de/640/image/upload/v1719997697/Impressions%20and%20Other%20Assets/Riu_Santa_Fe_-_Cabo_San_Lucas_b1ap1y.png" length="412045" type="image/jpeg"></enclosure></item><item><title>Weeklong Cairo, Egypt Getaway With Pyramid Views from $785🏺</title><link>https://www.travelpirates.com/packages/cairo-getaway-with-pyramid-views</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.travelpirates.com/packages/cairo-getaway-with-pyramid-views</guid><pubDate>Wed, 04 Nov 2026 12:39:10 -0500</pubDate><description>If seeing the Great Pyramids of Giza are on your travel bucket list, you're going to want to take advantage of this deal we found. Fly out to Cairo in February and spend six nights at a well-rated () hotel with prime views of the pyramids from just $785 in total. Given that flights to Cairo are normally $800+, this is a fantastic deal.</description><enclosure url="https://image.urlaubspiraten.de/640/image/upload/v1746785079/Impressions%20and%20Other%20Assets/Giza_Pyramids_View_InnNEW1_hijtfp.jpg" length="32119" type="image/jpeg"></enclosure></item><item><title>Snowbirds, We've Found Bargain Flights South This Winter 🌞✈️</title><link>https://www.travelpirates.com/flights/snowbird-flights-south</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.travelpirates.com/flights/snowbird-flights-south</guid><pubDate>Wed, 04 Nov 2026 11:22:27 -0500</pubDate><description>Attention, snowbirds! We've found super affordable one-way flights to the south of the US from $19, just in time to escape the winter cold. We've highlighted destinations in sunny hotspots like Miami, Orlando, Tampa, Charleston, San Diego, and more. Plus, these flights are nonstop.</description><enclosure url="https://image.urlaubspiraten.de/640/image/upload/v1603292641/mediavault_images/jur8gg7d902wsfka353p.jpg" length="69308" type="image/jpeg"></enclosure></item><item><title>Adults-Only &amp; All-Inclusive Caribbean Getaway 🩵 🥥</title><link>https://www.travelpirates.com/packages/adults-only-and-all-inclusive-caribbean-getaway</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.travelpirates.com/packages/adults-only-and-all-inclusive-caribbean-getaway</guid><pubDate>Wed, 04 Nov 2026 10:12:44 -0500</pubDate><description>Pirates, we are in dire need of some Vitamin Sea, so why not take a little break in the Caribbean? Get ready for a three-night Dominican Republic vacation, including round-trip airfare and a stay at the HM Alma de Bayahibe - Adults Only (), starting from $522 per person. Did we mention it's also all-inclusive?</description><enclosure url="https://image.urlaubspiraten.de/640/image/upload/v1700651103/Impressions%20and%20Other%20Assets/503937397_gng4d3.jpg" length="56934" type="image/jpeg"></enclosure></item><item><title>Fly to Norway's Lapland Region When Northern Lights Are At Their Peak 🌌 ❄️</title><link>https://www.travelpirates.com/flights/fly-to-tromso-norway-and-catch-the-northern-lights</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.travelpirates.com/flights/fly-to-tromso-norway-and-catch-the-northern-lights</guid><pubDate>Wed, 04 Nov 2026 09:42:12 -0500</pubDate><description>Explore the northern Lapland region of Norway. The sun is currently at a solar maximum through 2026, making this your last chance, and potentially the best opportunity, for at least another decade to see the Aurora Borealis at its peak. Experience the Northern Lights with flights to Tromsø from $460 round trip.Please note that the following flights carry some long or multiple layovers in Scandinavia. However, how about  with one flight ticket?</description><enclosure url="https://image.urlaubspiraten.de/640/image/upload/v1650989607/mediavault_images/AdobeStock_268146346_xjsdfz.jpg" length="65905" type="image/jpeg"></enclosure></item><item><title>European-Styled Christmas Markets Around Canada 🎄🇨🇦</title><link>https://www.travelpirates.com/hotels/european-styled-christmas-markets-around-canada</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.travelpirates.com/hotels/european-styled-christmas-markets-around-canada</guid><pubDate>Wed, 04 Nov 2026 09:13:08 -0500</pubDate><description>We originally shared . Now, we've compiled seven Christmas markets around Canada that have European vibes. Below, we've provided great-value hotel options in each location during peak Christmas market dates. We've even found some affordable luxury Fairmont hotel options below!</description><enclosure url="https://image.urlaubspiraten.de/640/image/upload/v1793797884/mediavault_images/shutterstock_2375340325_hmczeq.jpg" length="69082" type="image/jpeg"></enclosure></item><item><title>This Hotel Has a Water Park, Rooftop Pool, &amp; Niagara Falls Views 💦 🤩</title><link>https://www.travelpirates.com/hotels/sheraton-fallsview-hotel</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.travelpirates.com/hotels/sheraton-fallsview-hotel</guid><pubDate>Wed, 04 Nov 2026 07:32:05 -0500</pubDate><description>Stay near Niagara Falls at this well-rated () four-star Sheraton Resort. Not only does this resort offer incredible views of the falls, but there's an indoor water park, casino, heated rooftop pool, spa, and so much more to keep you entertained. We found rates this fall from $93 a night.</description><enclosure url="https://image.urlaubspiraten.de/640/image/upload/v1691413638/Impressions%20and%20Other%20Assets/Sheraton10_scsalf.jpg" length="79853" type="image/jpeg"></enclosure></item><item><title>Epic Weeklong Alaska Cruise on Princess Cruises 🛳️😍✨</title><link>https://www.travelpirates.com/cruises/epic-weeklong-alaska-cruise-princess-cruises</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.travelpirates.com/cruises/epic-weeklong-alaska-cruise-princess-cruises</guid><pubDate>Wed, 04 Nov 2026 07:28:55 -0500</pubDate><description>Pirates, we've found a bucket-list Alaska cruise for an excellent value!Check out this 7-night Princess Cruises cruise sailing in and out of Vancouver, hitting ports like Ketchikan, Juneau, and Skagway, with scenic cruises through Endicott Arm and Dawes Glacier.Princess Cruises is one of the top-rated Alaska cruise lines and is sure to provide a great-value, upscale experience. Plus, early-bird deals in May and June get you to Alaska during peak dates.We've planned the cruise out for you with flights and a night in Vancouver pre-departure to toast the start of your dream trip! We've found the , complete with a rooftop pool with incredible downtown views. </description><enclosure url="https://image.urlaubspiraten.de/640/image/upload/v1694685181/mediavault_images/shutterstock_1817047292_2_eyis0r.jpg" length="62348" type="image/jpeg"></enclosure></item><item><title>Explore Peru and See One of the World’s Wonders at Machu Picchu ✈️ 🇵🇪 🦙</title><link>https://www.travelpirates.com/flights/explore-peru-and-see-one-of-the-worlds-wonders-at-machu-picchu</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.travelpirates.com/flights/explore-peru-and-see-one-of-the-worlds-wonders-at-machu-picchu</guid><pubDate>Wed, 04 Nov 2026 06:31:36 -0500</pubDate><description>Pirates! We’ve found a great deal for your next Peru trip. Fly into Lima from $392 (usually $800+) and start your trip in a fun coastal city known for amazing food, ocean views, and lively neighbourhoods. From there, head up to Cusco and the Sacred Valley by domestic flight, train, or bus, where the scenery only gets better.The big highlight is Machu Picchu, walking through the ancient ruins surrounded by epic Andes views is a true bucket-list moment. You can also hike to Rainbow Mountain, famous for its colorful layered slopes and unreal mountain views at over 16,404 feet up.It’s a mix of culture, adventure, and nonstop “wow” moments, and with flight prices rising, it’s a deal worth jumping on.</description><enclosure url="https://image.urlaubspiraten.de/640/image/upload/v1603288135/mediavault_images/njbgqgw61gaswaioz2et.jpg" length="55916" type="image/jpeg"></enclosure></item><item><title>We're Obsessed With This Beachfront St Lucia Resort 🌺🥥</title><link>https://www.travelpirates.com/hotels/st-lucia-bay-gardens-beach-resort</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.travelpirates.com/hotels/st-lucia-bay-gardens-beach-resort</guid><pubDate>Wed, 04 Nov 2026 06:08:32 -0500</pubDate><description>Escape to paradise with this incredible deal to the Bay Gardens Beach Resort &amp; Spa (), a 4-star tropical oasis located on St Lucia's famous Reduit Beach. You can enjoy unlimited access to the Splash Island Water Park, lounge beside the resort’s lagoon-style swimming pool, complete with a whirlpool and swim-up pool bar, or pamper yourself at the on-site La Mer Spa. These rates also include free breakfast!Usually rates climb above $300 per night, but luckily today we've found rates from $136 per night! This deal covers peak winter and spring dates through May.</description><enclosure url="https://image.urlaubspiraten.de/640/image/upload/v1793788550/Impressions%20and%20Other%20Assets/251987165_cjvwxu.jpg" length="81796" type="image/jpeg"></enclosure></item><item><title>Malta Getaway at a Resort With Epic Rooftop &amp; Cave Pools 🏊‍♀️ </title><link>https://www.travelpirates.com/packages/malta-getaway-with-a-cave-pool-resort</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.travelpirates.com/packages/malta-getaway-with-a-cave-pool-resort</guid><pubDate>Wed, 04 Nov 2026 04:24:07 -0500</pubDate><description>This hotel in Malta is SO dreamy. The well-rated () Damare Resort &amp; Spa in Malta has an amazing rooftop pool and an indoor cave pool and spa. We found a six-night stay from $327.50 per person (based on two sharing) and we have paired that with round-trip flights to Malta from $552 more. In total, this 5-night getaway will cost you $879.50 per person.</description><enclosure url="https://image.urlaubspiraten.de/640/image/upload/v1759145772/Impressions%20and%20Other%20Assets/Screenshot_2025-09-29_at_12.34.21_bbnfe5.png" length="447108" type="image/jpeg"></enclosure></item><item><title>Stay in a Historic Train Hotel in the Heart of Chattanooga 🚂</title><link>https://www.travelpirates.com/hotels/historic-train-hotel-chattanooga-choo-choo</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.travelpirates.com/hotels/historic-train-hotel-chattanooga-choo-choo</guid><pubDate>Wed, 04 Nov 2026 04:11:42 -0500</pubDate><description>All aboard! But make it boutique. 🚂We’ve found great deals for one of Chattanooga’s coolest stays, set inside the historic Chattanooga Choo Choo complex in the city’s Southside neighborhood. The Hotel Chalet at The Choo Choo (rated 4.7/5 on Tripadvisor) is part of one of Chattanooga’s most iconic landmarks, leaning hard into the nostalgia without feeling dated. The property features an alpine-themed outdoor pool with fire pits, an on-site Appalachian bistro, and heated bathroom floors that make even a budget room feel like an upgrade. Rates start from $101 a night, with the lowest prices in January and solid availability and great prices through winter.For a Chattanooga getaway with a little history, a little comfort, and a lot more personality than your standard chain hotel, this one is a seriously fun find.🏴‍☠️ Pirate tip: The location is a big win, too. You’ll be right in downtown Chattanooga, about 0.5 miles from Finley Stadium, 0.8 miles from Tivoli Theatre, and 1.3 miles from the Tennessee Aquarium and Hunter Museum of American Art.</description><enclosure url="https://image.urlaubspiraten.de/640/image/upload/v1781601032/Impressions%20and%20Other%20Assets/The_Hotel_Chalet_at_The_Choo_Choo_2_lytnks.jpg" length="56432" type="image/jpeg"></enclosure></item><item><title>Explore the Best of Scotland in One Magical Trip 🏰 🏴󠁧󠁢󠁳󠁣󠁴󠁿</title><link>https://www.travelpirates.com/packages/explore-the-scottish-highlands</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.travelpirates.com/packages/explore-the-scottish-highlands</guid><pubDate>Wed, 04 Nov 2026 03:49:43 -0500</pubDate><description>Castles, coastlines, and misty glens—Scotland’s Highlands are calling! On this unforgettable 6-night  journey, you’ll explore the cobbled charm of Edinburgh, cruise the legendary Loch Ness, and take in the dramatic beauty of the Isle of Skye, all with comfort and convenience built in.We found packages from $2,249 per person through , including roundtrip flights, hand-picked hotel stays, daily breakfast, and expert-guided tours across some of Scotland’s most iconic landscapes. Trip highlights include a whisky distillery tour and tasting, visits to Stirling, Glasgow, and the Highlands, and a scenic cruise that might just deliver a Nessie sighting.This trip is currently 70% off for black friday, so we think it's a fantastic time to book!</description><enclosure url="https://image.urlaubspiraten.de/640/image/upload/v1628090910/mediavault_images/AdobeStock_287777190_fk1pea.jpg" length="80941" type="image/jpeg"></enclosure></item><item><title>Enjoy Beachside Family Fun at This St. Pete Hotel 🌊 </title><link>https://www.travelpirates.com/hotels/beachside-family-fun-st-petes</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.travelpirates.com/hotels/beachside-family-fun-st-petes</guid><pubDate>Wed, 04 Nov 2026 03:45:31 -0500</pubDate><description>Set on 28 acres of white sand in St. Pete Beach, Island Grand at TradeWinds () is the kind of place where the kids can zoom down a water slide while you sip something tropical in a beach cabana. Stays start from $184 a night for up to four guests, and with five outdoor pools, eight restaurants and bars, and Gulf views in select rooms, you’re getting serious vacation value.There’s no shortage of ways to play: take a ride on the resort zipline (yes, it’s for both kids and adults!), paddle through the water in a boat or on a board, play a game of beach volleyball, go down an enormous beachfront slide, or float your worries away in a lounger. Kids will love Shelldon’s Adventure Club, with themed day camps and Kids Night Out programs available for a fee. They even have movie nights in the pool!</description><enclosure url="https://image.urlaubspiraten.de/640/image/upload/v1746184780/Impressions%20and%20Other%20Assets/Island_Grand_at_TradeWinds_-_12_emhuvg.jpg" length="31764" type="image/jpeg"></enclosure></item><item><title>❄️ Head to Iceland with Nonstop Flights From $417 🔥</title><link>https://www.travelpirates.com/flights/head-to-iceland-with-nonstop-flights</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.travelpirates.com/flights/head-to-iceland-with-nonstop-flights</guid><pubDate>Wed, 04 Nov 2026 02:47:08 -0500</pubDate><description>Ready for an unforgettable adventure? We found nonstop flights to Iceland from $417! 😱 Iceland is truly one of a kind, with landscapes that somehow feel even more dramatic in person. You can swim between tectonic plates, chase waterfalls, soak in geothermal lagoons, explore lava fields, hike across glaciers, and walk along black sand beaches that look like they belong on another planet. 🌌Even better, we found some of the best flight prices from December through February, when Iceland's long winter nights make it an especially good time to go Northern Lights hunting. You'll also get snowy landscapes, steaming geothermal pools, and a completely different side of Iceland than you'd see in summer.Below, we've also compiled a list of unique hotels to check out while you're in Iceland. ⬇️🏴‍☠️ Pirate Tip: December through February is where we're seeing some of the best flight prices. Winter also means long, dark evenings for Northern Lights hunting, snowy scenery, fewer crowds at many popular sights, and plenty of geothermal pools, waterfalls, and dramatic landscapes to explore.</description><enclosure url="https://image.urlaubspiraten.de/640/image/upload/v1675782746/Impressions%20and%20Other%20Assets/Iceland_rhzbpp.jpg" length="45398" type="image/jpeg"></enclosure></item><item><title>Costa Rica Beach Vacation Right on Jaco with Flights 🌴 🩵</title><link>https://www.travelpirates.com/packages/paradise-jaco-costa-rica-beach-vacation-package</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.travelpirates.com/packages/paradise-jaco-costa-rica-beach-vacation-package</guid><pubDate>Tue, 03 Nov 2026 17:16:47 -0500</pubDate><description>Pirates, how about four nights in Costa Rica, right on the beach, with flights included from $482 per person? You’ll be staying in Jacó, one of the country’s most popular surf towns, at a hotel that’s actually beachfront. No roads to cross, just walk straight onto the sand.The Paradise Jaco Hotel Beach Front isn’t a luxury resort, but with an oceanfront pool, breakfast included, and plenty of restaurants and bars within walking distance, you’re getting a pretty good setup for the price. Plus, Jacó is known for its surfing and Pacific sunsets, so there’s plenty to enjoy without venturing too far from the hotel.🏴‍☠️ Pirate Tip: If you’re driving from San José to Jacó, keep an eye out for the Crocodile Bridge over the Tárcoles River. It’s a popular stop where you can sometimes spot massive crocodiles in the water below. Just make sure to view them from a safe, designated area.</description><enclosure url="https://image.urlaubspiraten.de/640/image/upload/v1793743586/Impressions%20and%20Other%20Assets/662202468_mukez6.jpg" length="48646" type="image/jpeg"></enclosure></item><item><title>Island Hop Through Greece's Ancient Wonders &amp; Sunsets 🇬🇷</title><link>https://www.travelpirates.com/packages/island-hop-greece-ancient-wonders-sunsets-exoticca</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.travelpirates.com/packages/island-hop-greece-ancient-wonders-sunsets-exoticca</guid><pubDate>Tue, 03 Nov 2026 14:09:29 -0500</pubDate><description>If Greece has been on your travel wish list, this might be the perfect excuse to finally go! 🇬🇷  sale has brought this incredible 9-day adventure down to $2,499 per person (60% off), with roundtrip flights, hotels, island ferries, and a guided tour of the Acropolis all included!You'll start in Athens, exploring ancient ruins and soaking up the city's history, before heading to Santorini for those dreamy whitewashed villages, blue-domed churches, and unforgettable sea views. Then it's off to Crete, where charming harbor towns, beautiful beaches, and centuries of history await.What we especially love about this trip is how much of the planning is already taken care of. You get to experience three of Greece's most beautiful destinations without worrying about booking separate hotels, arranging transfers, or figuring out how to get between the islands. Just pack your bags and enjoy!</description><enclosure url="https://image.urlaubspiraten.de/640/image/upload/v1628090544/mediavault_images/AdobeStock_165543572_ry6mxc.jpg" length="59965" type="image/jpeg"></enclosure></item><item><title>A Key West Vacation at the New Hilton With Six Saltwater Pools 🌴 🏊</title><link>https://www.travelpirates.com/packages/hilton-key-west-resort-marina-vacation-package</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.travelpirates.com/packages/hilton-key-west-resort-marina-vacation-package</guid><pubDate>Tue, 03 Nov 2026 13:29:19 -0500</pubDate><description>Pirates, Key West welcomed a brand-new Hilton Hotel in July 2026, and we’ve found a four-night vacation package with flights included from $472 per person!The new Hilton Key West Resort &amp; Marina (), formerly Ocean’s Edge, sits right on the waterfront, and one of our favorite things about this property is that it has not one, not two, but SIX saltwater swimming pools! You’ll also find many rooms with private balconies overlooking the marina and the water.And with Key West hotel prices as they are, getting four nights with flights at this rate is definitely something we’d be excited about.</description><enclosure url="https://image.urlaubspiraten.de/640/image/upload/v1793730451/Impressions%20and%20Other%20Assets/930985133_em4wia.jpg" length="76636" type="image/jpeg"></enclosure></item><item><title>✈️ Fly to New Orleans for Mardi Gras This Year 🎷🎭</title><link>https://www.travelpirates.com/flights/fly-to-new-orleans-for-mardi-gras-this-year</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.travelpirates.com/flights/fly-to-new-orleans-for-mardi-gras-this-year</guid><pubDate>Tue, 03 Nov 2026 12:15:52 -0500</pubDate><description>Wow. While you'd usually pay over $300 for flights to New Orleans for Mardi Gras, you can book these early-bird flights from just $72 round trip. Mardi Gras falls on February 9th this year, so we've grabbed flights that put you there in the middle of all the action!Pirate Insight 🏴‍☠️: We've found a  from $195 per night during these dates.</description><enclosure url="https://image.urlaubspiraten.de/640/image/upload/v1661519661/Impressions%20and%20Other%20Assets/shutterstock_1041591835_rzkkbc.jpg" length="79721" type="image/jpeg"></enclosure></item><item><title>This Massive Resort &amp; Waterpark in the Rockies has It All 🤿</title><link>https://www.travelpirates.com/hotels/this-massive-resort-and-waterpark-in-the-rockies-has-it-all</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.travelpirates.com/hotels/this-massive-resort-and-waterpark-in-the-rockies-has-it-all</guid><pubDate>Tue, 03 Nov 2026 10:26:28 -0500</pubDate><description>Pirates, by now you know we love a hotel with a view, and when you throw in a waterpark, it’s basically magic. The Gaylord Rockies Resort &amp; Convention Center comes in at $338 per night for four people, which breaks down to just $84 per person.This place is massive, over 500,000 square feet, with an indoor and outdoor waterpark that has lazy rivers, adults-only pools, and heated pools you can use year-round. Yes, that means swimming outside while it’s snowing in Colorado. Add multiple restaurants, mountain views, and a full spa, and you’ve got yourself a pretty epic mountain escape.</description><enclosure url="https://image.urlaubspiraten.de/640/image/upload/v1771598224/Impressions%20and%20Other%20Assets/806385722_wrhisx.jpg" length="52991" type="image/jpeg"></enclosure></item><item><title>You Won't Believe the Views at this Sedona Hyatt Hotel 🌵🏜️</title><link>https://www.travelpirates.com/hotels/you-wont-believe-the-views-at-this-sedona-hyatt-hotel</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.travelpirates.com/hotels/you-wont-believe-the-views-at-this-sedona-hyatt-hotel</guid><pubDate>Tue, 03 Nov 2026 07:17:49 -0500</pubDate><description>Sedona, Arizona hotels are notoriously expensive, but we've found bargain prices at the stunning 3.5-star Hyatt Vacation Club at Piñon Pointe (). Enjoy spectacular views of the surrounding red rocks, a gorgeous heated pool open year-round, a fitness center, and more. We've found great-value deals on plenty of dates through July. Compare to alternative dates over $400 per night!These rooms fit up to four guests, so are a fantastic value for groups or families. And split between four, you'll only be paying $39 per person.</description><enclosure url="https://image.urlaubspiraten.de/640/image/upload/v1753436049/Impressions%20and%20Other%20Assets/hyatt-residence-club_q3p2eu.jpg" length="66987" type="image/jpeg"></enclosure></item><item><title>Florence Without the Crowds Is Our Kind of Italian Getaway 🇮🇹</title><link>https://www.travelpirates.com/flights/flight-florence-explore-tuscany</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.travelpirates.com/flights/flight-florence-explore-tuscany</guid><pubDate>Tue, 03 Nov 2026 07:03:45 -0500</pubDate><description>Florence is one of those cities that's even more beautiful in person. 😍 Think cobblestone streets, incredible pasta, charming piazzas, and Renaissance masterpieces around every corner. And while summer brings heat and crowds, winter offers a quieter, more relaxed side of this Italian favorite.We've found roundtrip flights to Florence from $504, with the best fares in January and February 2027. It's a great opportunity to explore Tuscany without the peak-season crowds or prices.Spend your days wandering the historic center, admiring Michelangelo's David, climbing the Duomo for incredible city views, and browsing the shops along the Ponte Vecchio. Of course, there's always time for fresh pasta and a glass of Tuscan wine!🏴‍☠️ Pirate Tip: Florence is also a fantastic base for exploring Tuscany. Take a day trip to Pisa or Siena, or venture into the countryside for charming hilltop villages and vineyards.</description><enclosure url="https://image.urlaubspiraten.de/640/image/upload/v1793708846/mediavault_images/shutterstock_2825762493_pw5i1p.jpg" length="75003" type="image/jpeg"></enclosure></item><item><title>The Ultimate Christmas Escape: Tallinn, Helsinki, &amp; Lapland 🎄</title><link>https://www.travelpirates.com/flights/fly-to-helsinki-and-visit-nearby-christmas-markets</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.travelpirates.com/flights/fly-to-helsinki-and-visit-nearby-christmas-markets</guid><pubDate>Tue, 03 Nov 2026 05:46:58 -0500</pubDate><description>Fly to Helsinki from just $407 round trip and spend your first night exploring festive Christmas markets.Next, take a 2-hour ferry to Tallinn, Estonia (return tickets from $46 per person), take in its storybook Old Town and world-famous markets.Return to Helsinki by ferry and then board an overnight sleeper train to Rovaniemi, Lapland (from $92 round trip)—home of Santa Claus Village.All in, transport between these three Christmas hot spots will cost you $545.</description><enclosure url="https://image.urlaubspiraten.de/640/image/upload/v1758121423/mediavault_images/Screenshot_2025-09-17_at_16.03.14_nmrial.png" length="372140" type="image/jpeg"></enclosure></item><item><title>Winter Group Getaway to the US Virgin Islands 😍🥥</title><link>https://www.travelpirates.com/packages/group-getaway-to-the-us-virgin-islands</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.travelpirates.com/packages/group-getaway-to-the-us-virgin-islands</guid><pubDate>Tue, 03 Nov 2026 05:46:38 -0500</pubDate><description>Pirates, we've found amazing prices on a winter group getaway to the US Virgin Islands! From $459 each, you can fly out to Saint Thomas and spend four nights for four at the 3-star . There, you can enjoy stunning views, a pool, and a studio suite with your own balcony and kitchenette. You would typically pay over $800 each for a US Virgin Islands group getaway — book now from over 40% off! The best-value rates are on peak winter dates through January.🏴‍☠️ Pirate Insight: You don't need a passport to enter Saint Thomas if you are a US citizen.</description><enclosure url="https://image.urlaubspiraten.de/640/image/upload/v1613471848/mediavault_images/GettyImages-502074756_bazlxr.jpg" length="88303" type="image/jpeg"></enclosure></item><item><title>Gimme Gimme Gimme a Flight Deal to Stockholm 🇸🇪💫</title><link>https://www.travelpirates.com/flights/stockholm-sweden-flights</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.travelpirates.com/flights/stockholm-sweden-flights</guid><pubDate>Tue, 03 Nov 2026 05:18:15 -0500</pubDate><description>Mamma mia, a winter escape to Stockholm is looking surprisingly affordable right now. 👀 We found round-trip flights from $396, with some of the best rates in this winter through spring, making is a great time to see Sweden’s capital for less.Stockholm spreads across 14 islands, so even in winter you’ll get waterfront views, colorful streets, cozy cafés, and plenty of museums to duck into when you need to warm up. Wander the cobblestone lanes of Gamla Stan, stop for a proper Swedish fika, and enjoy a quieter side of the city before the busier spring and summer months.A visit in December or January does mean shorter days, but Stockholm knows how to make winter feel cozy. Think twinkling lights, candlelit restaurants, snowy streets if you’re lucky, and plenty of reasons to linger over coffee and cinnamon buns.🏴‍☠️ Pirate Tip: ABBA fans, this is your sign. The  is in Stockholm, with costumes, memorabilia, interactive exhibits, and enough Dancing Queen energy to make it worth adding to your itinerary. 🎶And yes, saying “Mamma Mia, here I go again” while booking another trip to Europe is fully encouraged.</description><enclosure url="https://image.urlaubspiraten.de/640/image/upload/v1789391086/mediavault_images/shutterstock_2275312769_1_yf6atv.jpg" length="70196" type="image/jpeg"></enclosure></item><item><title>Olá, Lisboa 👋 6-Night Vacation to Lisbon, Portugal this Winter 🇵🇹☀️✈️</title><link>https://www.travelpirates.com/packages/ola-lisboa-6-night-vacation-to-lisbon-portugal-this-winter</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.travelpirates.com/packages/ola-lisboa-6-night-vacation-to-lisbon-portugal-this-winter</guid><pubDate>Tue, 03 Nov 2026 05:11:28 -0500</pubDate><description>Lisbon is pure magic. You’ve got vintage yellow trams rattling up steep hills, pastel buildings covered in gorgeous tiles, and insane views around every corner. By day, you're stuffing your face with warm, flaky pastéis de nata (custard tarts) and exploring old castle ruins; by night, you're sipping green wine in Bairro Alto while soulful Fado music echoes through the alleyways. It’s got all the rich history of a European capital but feels like a laid-back, sun-drenched beach town.We've found great rates for a 6-night vacation with flights included from $664 per person this December, arguably the one of the best times to visit after the summer and shoulder season crowds have left the city. </description><enclosure url="https://image.urlaubspiraten.de/640/image/upload/v1767959969/Impressions%20and%20Other%20Assets/Lisbon_d3kgdz.jpg" length="80585" type="image/jpeg"></enclosure></item><item><title>This Hotel Chain in the US Offers Rooms With Private Pools 🏊‍♀️</title><link>https://www.travelpirates.com/hotels/hotel-chain-offers-rooms-with-private-pools</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.travelpirates.com/hotels/hotel-chain-offers-rooms-with-private-pools</guid><pubDate>Tue, 03 Nov 2026 05:07:25 -0500</pubDate><description>We found the perfect romantic stay. This hotel chain is adults only in the midwest with properties in Illinois, Wisconsin, and Indiana, and offers rooms with private whirlpools or you can even opt for a room with a full private pool. Below, we found availability for three out of the five properties listed on their website. Stay at the Sybaris in Mequon, Wisconsin, which was rated (), the Sybaris Downers Grove in Illinois, which is rated (), or the Sybaris Indianapolis rated a ().Please note: these properties are popular and have limited availability. If you want to book the room with a private pool, nightly rates start from $470. Standard hot tub rooms start from $165.</description><enclosure url="https://image.urlaubspiraten.de/640/image/upload/v1761122316/Impressions%20and%20Other%20Assets/SybarisMequon3_n9o4ge.jpg" length="66461" type="image/jpeg"></enclosure></item><item><title>There's an IKEA Hotel in Sweden 💙 💛</title><link>https://www.travelpirates.com/hotels/theres-an-ikea-hotel-in-sweden</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.travelpirates.com/hotels/theres-an-ikea-hotel-in-sweden</guid><pubDate>Tue, 03 Nov 2026 04:33:40 -0500</pubDate><description>Are you a huge fan of IKEA and its products? Did you know there's an IKEA hotel experience in its home country of Sweden? You can stay at the IKEA hotel in Almihult from just $95 a night. All the rooms are fit with IKEA furniture (assembly not required) and they even have a restaurant that offers incredible dishes, perhaps a bit fancier than the typical IKEA cafe. However, if you are looking for your beloved meatballs and cinnamon rolls there's an IKEA restaurant and an IKEA museum both off the property but in the same city that offers all the favorites. Breakfast at the hotel restaurant is included in the price!</description><enclosure url="https://image.urlaubspiraten.de/640/image/upload/v1704893866/Impressions%20and%20Other%20Assets/Ikea_h1pswn.jpg" length="75886" type="image/jpeg"></enclosure></item><item><title>Forget Lake Louise...Stay on This Lake in the Canadian Rockies 🏔️ 🛶</title><link>https://www.travelpirates.com/hotels/is-this-the-new-hotspot-in-the-canadian-rockies</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.travelpirates.com/hotels/is-this-the-new-hotspot-in-the-canadian-rockies</guid><pubDate>Tue, 03 Nov 2026 03:46:23 -0500</pubDate><description>A little over an hour's drive from Banff, Canada, and a half an hour's drive from Lake Louise, sits Emerald Lake in Field, British Columbia. Emerald Lake offers the same stunning turquoise-blue waters that can be found in Lake Louise and is also surrounded by the Rockies. A less touristy location, this spot may offer the perfect alternative to a trip to busy Banff. Fly into Calgary and venture two-and-a-half hours northwest The Emerald Lake Lodge is a 4-star and well-rated accommodation () right on Emerald Lake. We've found fall rates from $113 a night, rates can reach $500+! Each room comes with a private balcony and fireplace. There are several restaurants and bars on the property.</description><enclosure url="https://image.urlaubspiraten.de/640/image/upload/v1720440670/Impressions%20and%20Other%20Assets/EmeraldLakeLodge6_tcheeh.jpg" length="80340" type="image/jpeg"></enclosure></item><item><title>A North Carolina Hotel Where Wild Horses Graze Across the Creek 🐴</title><link>https://www.travelpirates.com/hotels/north-carolina-hotel-wild-horses-beaufort</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.travelpirates.com/hotels/north-carolina-hotel-wild-horses-beaufort</guid><pubDate>Tue, 03 Nov 2026 03:32:00 -0500</pubDate><description>Our readers can't get enough of hotels with a view, and this one comes with wild horses grazing on the islands across the water! 😍🌊Across Taylor's Creek from this waterfront hotel on North Carolina's Crystal Coast, a herd of about 30 wild horses roams the marshes and beaches of the Rachel Carson Reserve, and you can watch for them right from your balcony.  () is a 133-room boutique hotel in Beaufort, a historic seaport town near the southern end of the Outer Banks. USA Today 10Best named it the country's No. 1 boutique hotel two years in a row.Summer is peak season here, when rates climb and wedding parties fill the weekends, so the cooler months are when the real value shows up. We found rooms from $125 per night between November and May, with December bringing the lowest rates.</description><enclosure url="https://image.urlaubspiraten.de/640/image/upload/v1793673025/Impressions%20and%20Other%20Assets/Beaufort_Hotel_1_qt50ec.jpg" length="46687" type="image/jpeg"></enclosure></item><item><title>Europe Travel Warnings: US Alerts Expand as Protests Spread</title><link>https://www.travelpirates.com/captains-log/europe-travel-warnings-protests-spread</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.travelpirates.com/captains-log/europe-travel-warnings-protests-spread</guid><pubDate>Wed, 04 Nov 2026 15:08:04 -0500</pubDate><description>The U.S. State Department has issued  for Americans in Portugal and France in recent days, as protests over housing and living costs spread across Europe and turned violent in parts of Germany, France, and Italy.The catch: these are alerts, not bans. France is still at , which means increased caution, but a nationwide strike on Thursday, November 5, could disrupt trains and public transport.If you are heading to Europe soon, enroll in STEP and check embassy alerts before you fly.</description><enclosure url="https://image.urlaubspiraten.de/640/image/upload/v1793822809/Impressions%20and%20Other%20Assets/01-europe-protests-travel-alert-berlin-police-hero_apst52.jpg" length="49058" type="image/jpeg"></enclosure></item><item><title>Villa Vie Odyssey: The Endless Cruise That Ended in Cambodia</title><link>https://www.travelpirates.com/captains-log/endless-cruise-ends-cambodia-villa-vie-odyssey</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.travelpirates.com/captains-log/endless-cruise-ends-cambodia-villa-vie-odyssey</guid><pubDate>Wed, 04 Nov 2026 14:00:28 -0500</pubDate><description>Selling the house to sail around the world sounds like the ultimate retirement plan, right up until the ship docks in Cambodia and asks everyone to leave. That's what happened to about 200 residents of the Villa Vie Odyssey, a residential cruise ship marketed as a never-ending voyage, when its operator suspended operations in late October, citing soaring fuel costs and financial difficulties. Paul and Lynn Montoya of Laramie, Wyoming, had paid $179,000 for a lifetime cabin. They were given just seven hours to pack up and leave. Suddenly, the couple who had planned to spend their retirement exploring the world had nowhere to call home.</description><enclosure url="https://image.urlaubspiraten.de/640/image/upload/v1793818792/Impressions%20and%20Other%20Assets/villa-vie-odyssey-endless-cruise-sihanoukville-cambodia_hz5gnn.jpg" length="59017" type="image/jpeg"></enclosure></item><item><title>European Christmas Market Dates 2026: When 35+ Top Markets Open and Close</title><link>https://www.travelpirates.com/captains-log/european-christmas-market-dates-2026</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.travelpirates.com/captains-log/european-christmas-market-dates-2026</guid><pubDate>Wed, 04 Nov 2026 05:16:38 -0500</pubDate><description>Planning a European Christmas market trip is surprisingly dependent on getting the dates right. Most of Europe’s big Christmas markets open sometime between November 13 and November 28, 2026, but the dates can vary more than you’d expect from one city to the next. That’s especially important if you’re planning a Thanksgiving trip or visiting during winter break, since some of Germany’s best-known markets are already wrapping up by Christmas Eve. We checked the 2026 dates against official city, tourism board and market websites so you don't have to. Thirty of the biggest Christmas market destinations in Europe have now confirmed their schedules, while a few popular markets are still waiting on complete 2026 details.</description><enclosure url="https://image.urlaubspiraten.de/640/image/upload/v1790670580/mediavault_images/shutterstock_1584320608_1_kmwhzw.jpg" length="118262" type="image/jpeg"></enclosure></item></channel></rss>